{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00269","headline":"九月九日上幸慈恩寺登浮图羣臣上菊花寿酒 · 上官昭容","name":"九月九日上幸慈恩寺登浮图羣臣上菊花寿酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝里重阳节，香园万乘来。\n却邪萸入佩，献寿菊传杯。\n墖类承天涌，门疑待佛开。\n睿词悬日月，长得仰昭回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官昭容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}